This product is a clean-room reimplementation. No source code was copied from
any repository in the author's estate. Two upstream projects informed the
architecture and remain the reference for future vendoring under ADR-001:

  hermes-atlas        MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Daniel Kliewer
                      https://github.com/<owner>/hermes-atlas
                      Donor for: the determinism gate (full equality + delta
                      isolation), the ledger, explain, and coverage-gap modules.
                      Not yet vendored — the substrate was written against
                      docs/architecture/data-model.md instead.

  sovereign-worker    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Daniel Kliewer
                      Donor for: the permission engine, the 13 deterministic
                      verifiers, the evidence ledger, the policy store, and the
