The epistemic state vocabulary, the proposal-only model, and the record shapes
are *design* lineage from ganymede3 (no LICENSE file as of 2026-09-27) and
authority-epistemic-protocol (no LICENSE file as of 2026-09-27). Per ADR-001
their implementations were read but not copied. If a license is later added to
either, a follow-up ADR may replace the reimplementation with a true port.
